# WP M2-45d — Export completeness, final part: metadata policy, DNG 1.6 and embedded raw, HDR output

M2-45/45b/45c are merged (AVIF, lossless JXL, float DNG, size limit, watermark, output sharpening, Export with Previous, multi-preset, post-actions, original + XMP mode). Read tools/orchestrate/wp/M2-45c/brief.md for the full remaining item list and tools/orchestrate/wp/M2-45c/ORIGINAL.md for state. Deliver, committing each item as it goes green:
1. **Metadata policy** (all / copyright / copyright + contact / all except camera & Camera Raw info; remove person info incl. face regions and person keywords; remove location; keywords as hierarchy) applied to EXIF, IPTC and XMP in JPEG, TIFF, PNG, AVIF, JXL and DNG, with per-policy, per-format read-back tests.
2. **DNG**: OriginalRawFileData embedding option, DNG 1.6 tag audit test, independent LibRaw RGB comparison of the developed float DNG against the engine render within tolerance.
3. **HDR output**: 16-bit PNG (cICP) and 10/12-bit AVIF in PQ and HLG with Rec.2020; ISO 21496-1 gain-map JPEG (SDR base + gain map + metadata), tags validated, ImageIO decode where supported, HDR reconstruction within tolerance.
